um/strains/white-widow/","summary":"","title":"White Widow"},{"content":"","permalink":"http://localhost:1313/vaporium/strains/gg4/","summary":"","title":"GG4"},{"content":"","permalink":"http://localhost:1313/vaporium/strains/wedding-cake/","summary":"","title":"Wedding Cake"},{"content":"","permalink":"http://localhost:1313/vaporium/strains/durban-poison/","summary":"","title":"Durban Poison"},{"content":"","permalink":"http://localhost:1313/vaporium/strains/northern-lights/","summary":"","title":"Northern Lights"},{"content":"","permalink":"http://localhost:1313/vaporium/strains/jack-herer/","summary":"","title":"Jack Herer"},{"content":"","permalink":"http://localhost:1313/vaporium/strains/granddaddy-purple/","summary":"","title":"Granddaddy Purple"},{"content":"","permalink":"http://localhost:1313/vaporium/strains/girl-scout-cookies/","summary":"","title":"Girl Scout Cookies"},{"content":"","permalink":"http://localhost:1313/vaporium/strains/sour-diesel/","summary":"","title":"Sour Diesel"},{"content":"","permalink":"http://localhost:1313/vaporium/strains/blue-dream/","summary":"","title":"Blue Dream"},{"content":"","permalink":"http://localhost:1313/vaporium/strains/og-kush/","summary":"","title":"OG Kush"},{"content":"Vaporium is a community project. Your experiences help others find the perfect vaporization setup. You can contribute in two ways:\n1. GitHub Pull Request For those familiar with Git, the best way to contribute is by sending a Pull Request directly to our repository.\nFork the repository: Vaporium Add your .md file to the content/strains/ or content/sessions/ folder. Submit your Pull Request. 2. Submit by Email If you are not a developer, you can send us an email with the details of your strain or session.\nPlease send the data in YML (Front Matter) format to: unalumnodel02@gmail.com\nData Templates Copy and fill these templates in your submission to ensure the data is processed correctly.\nNew Strain Template --- date: \u0026#39;{{ .Date }}\u0026#39; draft: true title: \u0026#39;{{ replace .File.ContentBaseName \u0026#34;-\u0026#34; \u0026#34; \u0026#34; | title }}\u0026#39; strain_id: \u0026#34;{{ .File.ContentBaseName }}\u0026#34; name: \u0026#34;{{ replace .File.ContentBaseName \u0026#34;-\u0026#34; \u0026#34; \u0026#34; | title }}\u0026#34; strain_type: \u0026#34;Hybrid\u0026#34; # Indica / Sativa / Hybrid thc: 0 cbd: 0 terpenes: [] aromas: [] # e.g., Citrus, Earthy, Pine effects: [] # e.g., Relaxing, Creative, Euphoria lineage: \u0026#34;\u0026#34; # Parentage link_reference: \u0026#34;\u0026#34; --- New Session Template --- date: \u0026#39;{{ .Date }}\u0026#39; draft: true title: \u0026#39;{{ replace .File.ContentBaseName \u0026#34;-\u0026#34; \u0026#34; \u0026#34; | title }}\u0026#39; strain: \u0026#34;\u0026#34; # Reference to the strain_id author: \u0026#34;\u0026#34; email_author: \u0026#34;\u0026#34; vaporizer: \u0026#34;\u0026#34; temperature: 0 # in °C session_duration: \u0026#34;\u0026#34; # e.g., 10 min aromas: [] # e.g., Herbal, Spicy, Fruity flavors: [] # e.g., Pine, Woody, Sweet activities: [] # e.g., Gaming, Reading, Nature, Social rating: 0 # 1 to 10 scale mood: [] # Feelings or mood, e.g., Relaxed, Euphoric, Creative, Focused --- ","permalink":"http://localhost:1313/vaporium/collaborate/","summary":"Learn how to contribute with new strains or session logs to the encyclopedia.","title":"How to Collaborate"}]